00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.360
You know, just for fun,

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.720
they should give him this many days.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:10.560
Oh.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.400
Yeah.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.220
Yeah.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:13.060
Yeah.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:13.900
Yeah.

