00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.120
So apparently Democrats have a new plan

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.080
to win back young men.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.959
And it's not inventing a time machine

00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:25.520
to undo the last eight years

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.280
where dudes wore mumus

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.360
and a dead guy was elected president.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.080
The party is testing everything

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.759
from beer ads to left-wing influencers.

00:00:35.759 --> 00:00:36.599
In other words,

00:00:36.599 --> 00:00:38.560
they're trying to rebrand a bad product

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.779
instead of putting out a good one.

00:00:40.779 --> 00:00:44.599
They're even trying something called gym outreach.

00:00:44.599 --> 00:00:46.080
Yeah, gym outreach,

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.000
which by the way,

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.320
was my stage name when I made those films

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.380
to pay my way through community college.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.099
Those were the days.

00:00:54.099 --> 00:00:55.400
Democrat operatives are paying

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.439
left-leaning fitness influencers

00:00:57.439 --> 00:00:58.880
to create online content.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.119
Think about that.

00:01:00.119 --> 00:01:02.200
They're paying guys to pretend

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.400
that they're masculine liberals.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.959
And here I thought that was what Hollywood was for.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:11.040
But the same guys who called physical fitness

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:13.320
white supremacy now pretend

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:15.519
that they like the bench press.

00:01:15.519 --> 00:01:17.239
Finally, a transition

00:01:17.239 --> 00:01:18.919
that doesn't make you cut anything off

00:01:18.919 --> 00:01:20.400
except the carbs.

